#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0095B expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "TRTAN absent. This rule declares no Requirements.Variables.All, so nothing gates it - it EXECUTES, the absent column folds to all-missing, not empty(TRTAN) is false on every row, and it reports nothing. Contrast PMDA-AD0092B-skipped_no_trtpn-ADLBC.cdt, whose identical Check shape SKIPS instead. Discriminating pair for family finding F2."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col TRTA    type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | DRUGA
